OL,3,AUK drone factories may face attacks
OL,4,Afrom 'unknown sources', says former
OL,5,ARussian minister
OL,6,
OL,7,FA Russian former deputy foreign
OL,8,Fminister has said there might be a
OL,9,F"semi-military" response against UK
OL,10,Fdrone factories by "unknown sources"
OL,11,Fover the sharing of blueprints for
OL,12,FBritish-made cruise missile components.
OL,14,FAndrei Fedorov's comments on BBC
OL,15,FNewsnight come as UK Prime Minister
OL,16,FAndy Burnham announced plans to travel
OL,17,Fto the US next month with European
OL,18,Fleaders to lobby President Donald Trump
OL,19,Fon Ukraine's defence needs.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
